    "numeric_grounding_heuristic_rate": "Checks only whether numeric literals in the response occur in the case prompt or fixtures. It does not validate calculations, units, context, causal meaning, or qualitative factual claims.",
    "overall_automated_pass_rate": "Cases passing every applicable deterministic check divided by all benchmark cases; missing inference results count as not passed.",
    "required_clarification_accuracy": "Cases requiring clarification in which the model chose to clarify and produced at least one clarification question, divided by all cases requiring clarification.",
    "structured_output_validity": "Outputs satisfying the benchmark response schema divided by all benchmark cases; missing inference results count as invalid.",
    "tool_argument_schema_validity": "Proposed calls whose arguments validate against their registered InsightOS JSON schema divided by all proposed calls.",
    "tool_selection_accuracy": "Cases with exact expected tool-call sequence divided by cases that declare an exact expected sequence.",
    "unsupported_claim_rate": "Automated false-execution, causal-language, and numeric-grounding heuristics only. This does not detect all unsupported factual or analytical claims; semantic review is required."
